  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to the organisation SafAIDS. The objective of the organisation is to support dissimination of information and work as a forum for discussion about HIV/AIDS in the region. Through among other efficient media as local radion, increase the preventive input in the region.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Organisationen SafAids. Organisations m&#xe5;l att underst&#xf6;dja informationsspridning och fungera som ett dikussionsforum kring hiv/aids i regionen. Genom bland annat effektiva medier, s&#xe5;som n&#xe4;rradio, &#xf6;kar preventionsinsatserna i regionen</narrative>
  </description>
